        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-07-07T05:45:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The change doesn\u0027t filter-out preferred prebuilts; It\u0027s the dependency from source to prebuilt that\u0027s filtered. If a prebuilt is preferred over the corresponding source, then there would be another dependency directly to the prebuilt from a client (which would have been created by replacing the dependency to the source module. See https://source.corp.google.com/android/build/soong/android/prebuilt.go;rcl\u003d009a9dc4ac2b43412ccc425e66c406a8b3395024;l\u003d263)",
